---
/* The curly divider. A single hand-drawn curl that draws itself in on
 * reveal, standing where a section changes subject. It replaces a flat
 * 64px hairline under the intro that read as a stray line at the page's
 * left edge. Same stroke, same draw-in as the scribble accents. */
---
<svg class="curl-divider reveal" viewBox="0 0 96 24" aria-hidden="true">
  <path style="--len:150" d="M3 15 C 12 4, 20 4, 26 12 C 32 20, 40 20, 46 12 C 52 4, 60 4, 66 12 C 72 20, 80 20, 86 12 C 89 8, 91 7, 93 7"/>
</svg>
